            "type": "markdown",
            "source": "The sound effects for Lllamatron all live in a binary file called [`sonix2.spl`](https://github.com/mwenge/llamatron/blob/master/src/sonix2.spl). We can extract them from the original game binary of `rude_llamatron.prg` as follows.",
